      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Index controllers don't really need auto hold. They have a grip sensor instead of a grab button, which isn't well suited to act as a button. A forced hold toggle would make holding things on Index awkward and unreliable.\n\nIf you're going to add a forced hold toggle, please either exclude Index controllers from it, or use a separate button for the \"release\" action for \"stickier\" pickups. As far as I understand this feature is mainly aimed at controllers that have an actual grab button, like Quest/Pico or Vive standalone.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
